WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.320
Reflection is structured review, not vague rumination.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:07.000
It asks what happened, why it happened, what was assumed, what evidence was used,

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.715
what changed, and what should be done differently next time.

00:00:09.715 --> 00:00:12.160
Reflection turns experience into reusable learning.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:12.670
Without it,

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:15.710
people may repeat events without extracting the pattern that would improve future

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:16.280
performance.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.630
Self-explanation is one of the most practical reflection tools.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:23.355
Instead of only naming the answer, explain why the answer works, why a step matters,

00:00:23.355 --> 00:00:24.560
or why an error happened.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:25.465
In technical work,

00:00:25.465 --> 00:00:28.880
this might mean explaining why one root cause is more likely than another.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:32.050
In writing, it might mean explaining why a section supports the main claim.

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:35.835
In leadership, it might mean explaining why a message created confusion.

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.070
Comparing predictions to outcomes strengthens reflection.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:41.240
Before acting, make a prediction: what do I expect to happen, and why?

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.784
Afterward, compare the result.

00:00:42.784 --> 00:00:46.575
If the outcome matched, ask whether the reasoning was actually sound or merely lucky.

00:00:46.575 --> 00:00:49.000
If it did not match, ask which assumption failed.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.385
This habit improves judgment because it connects thinking to evidence.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.495
Personal after-action reviews, learning journals,

00:00:54.495 --> 00:00:56.795
and decision notes can make reflection easier.

00:00:56.795 --> 00:00:58.381
They do not need to be elaborate.

00:00:58.381 --> 00:01:01.895
Record the goal, the approach, the uncertainty, the result, the feedback,

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:02.755
and the adjustment.

00:01:02.755 --> 00:01:06.320
Over time, those notes reveal recurring gaps and useful patterns.

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:09.710
Reflection becomes less about criticizing yourself and more about building a memory system

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:10.400
for better work.
